    "category": "Queue",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Design a data structure that receives a stream of non-negative integers. After each insertion, maintain the numbers as a list of disjoint sorted intervals. Support the following operations: addNum(value) getIntervals() Process a sequence of operations and print the intervals whenever getIntervals() is called.",
